  - minimum line cover
  - set cover
  - exact search
  - parallel search
  - branch and bound
  - Lagrangian relaxation
  - cover inequalities
  - witness propagation
  - incremental sweep
  - awkward primes
  - OEIS A373813
  - OEIS A393445
